			"originalText": "SPLIT RULE: entry in old bucket[i] moves to either\n  new bucket[i]          if (hash & newBucketMask) == i\n  new bucket[i + 2^(B-1)] if the extra bit is set\n\nold bucket[0] entries split into new bucket[0] and new bucket[2]",
